should double-check: does `docs/README.md` need to link `docs/dev/...`? The docs-index test only checks top-level `docs/*.md` files are linked. My new doc is in `docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/`, not top-level, so no docs/README change needed. Good (S02/S03 also didn't touch it).\n\nLet me look at final file contents once to confirm formatting."}}
